now `distillChunksAlreadyDone`, a value the loop calls, and the test drives that.\n\nFull `internal/cli` suite green, every other package green, `go vet ./...` clean.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nBODY","description":"Open the PR","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
